{"ref":"BDB, נוֹדָ֑ב","hw":"נוֹדָ֑ב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נוֹדָ֑ב</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.gent.</strong> Arab tribe according to <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.19\">1 Ch 5:19</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">יְטוּר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נָפִישׁ</span> q.v. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:15\" href=\"/Genesis.25.15\">Gn 25:15</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.31\">1 Ch 1:31</a>); 𝔊 Ναδαβαιων. <strong>(</strong>Connex. with above √ quite uncertain.<strong>)</strong>","next":"BDB, נְדַבְיָה","prev":"BDB, נְדִיבָה"}